---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /help/index.html
title: "CueCard Help | Recording, Scripts, AI & Apple Watch"
description: "Get started with CueCard, fix a missing floating window, find your Takes, save scripts safely, and set up voice-following or Apple Watch."
canonical: "https://cuecard.dev/help/"
crumbs:
  - name: CueCard
    url: /
  - name: Help
    url: /help/
---
{% block body %}
{% include "partials/nav.njk" %}
<main id="main-content" tabindex="-1">
  <header class="guide-header wrap">
    {% include "partials/breadcrumbs.njk" %}
    <p class="micro">CueCard Help</p>
    <h1 class="display">Back to <em>your next take.</em></h1>
    <p class="body">Find the steps, understand the controls, and get unstuck. Start with what you want to do.</p>
    <div class="help-search" data-help-search hidden>
      <label for="help-query">Search help</label>
      <input id="help-query" type="search" placeholder="Try camera, backup, voice or Watch" autocomplete="off" aria-controls="help-topics">
      <p id="help-results" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
  </header>
  <section class="wrap help-list" aria-label="Help topics">
    <div class="help-grid" id="help-topics">
      {% for article in helpArticles %}
      <a class="help-card" href="/{{ article.slug }}/" data-help-topic data-search="{{ article.title }} {{ article.description }} {{ article.category }} {{ article.body | striptags }}">
        <span class="micro">{{ article.category }}</span><h2>{{ article.title }}</h2><p>{{ article.description }}</p><span class="help-card-link">Read the guide →</span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p data-help-empty hidden>No matching guides. Try a shorter phrase, browse all topics by clearing the search, or <a href="/support/">contact support</a>.</p>
    <div class="help-contact"><h2>Looking for something else?</h2><p><a href="/faq/">Read the FAQ</a> for compatibility, pricing and desktop questions. <a href="/support/">Contact a person</a> if you need more help.</p></div>
  </section>
</main>
{% include "partials/footer.njk" %}
{% endblock %}
